# Language models

Language-model features call OpenRouter. Try `openrouter/free`, then `meta-llama/llama-3.2-3b-instruct:free`, then `qwen/qwen-2.5-7b-instruct:free`. If those fail, try `OPENROUTER_FALLBACK_MODEL` when it is set. If the key is missing or every model fails, use the local heuristic.

Do not send photographs, patient names, clinic names, or identifiers. Keep `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` server-only. Computer vision stays on the device.
